(5071644, 738992, 27161, '<td valign="top">Very microscopic looking.  This reminds me of my photo.  I had a difficult time deciding how to crop it because the DOF is so limiting on the macro scale.  I probably would have cut out the lower quarter of this photo so that the viewer isn''t distracted by the OOF spikes on the lower left hand corner.  I definitely think that would make it stronger.<br/> <br/>**after challenge**<br/> <br/>but you obviously knew better than me.  Congrats on the high finish!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-26 03:35:08.</i></td>', 'Very microscopic looking.  This reminds me of my photo.  I had a difficult time deciding how to crop it because the DOF is so limiting on the macro scale.  I probably would have cut out the lower quarter of this photo so that the viewer isn''t distracted by the OOF spikes on the lower left hand corner.  I definitely think that would make it stronger. **after challenge** but you obviously knew better than me.  Congrats on the high finish!', '2008-11-19 06:27:41.000000', '2008-11-26 03:35:08.000000', 1),
(5071646, 739938, 27161, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems to harsh on the (brush?)  If there is any way you can use multiple lights, lamps, etc... I think that would help to give the photo more dimension.</td>', 'The lighting seems to harsh on the (brush?)  If there is any way you can use multiple lights, lamps, etc... I think that would help to give the photo more dimension.', '2008-11-19 06:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
