(5071757, 740303, 27161, '<td valign="top">looks like an impressionist painting.  I can''t find any details that allow me to contemplate what it is.  I think this will hurt your scoring.  It really needs some edges, coloring, or texture that help the viewer along a little bit.  Even if the viewer has no idea what it is, it is hard to imagine it being anything.</td>', 'looks like an impressionist painting.  I can''t find any details that allow me to contemplate what it is.  I think this will hurt your scoring.  It really needs some edges, coloring, or texture that help the viewer along a little bit.  Even if the viewer has no idea what it is, it is hard to imagine it being anything.', '2008-11-19 07:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071758, 738947, 27161, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken lots of macros, but I never macro''d a ball point pen before.  Hmm... so there really is a little ball down there. 7 for enlightening me.</td>', 'I''ve taken lots of macros, but I never macro''d a ball point pen before.  Hmm... so there really is a little ball down there. 7 for enlightening me.', '2008-11-19 07:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071759, 740184, 27161, '<td valign="top">looks like an impressionist painting.  I can''t find any details that allow me to contemplate what it is.  I think this will hurt your scoring.  It really needs some edges, coloring, or texture that help the viewer along a little bit.  Even if the viewer has no idea what it is, it is hard to imagine it being anything.</td>', 'looks like an impressionist painting.  I can''t find any details that allow me to contemplate what it is.  I think this will hurt your scoring.  It really needs some edges, coloring, or texture that help the viewer along a little bit.  Even if the viewer has no idea what it is, it is hard to imagine it being anything.', '2008-11-19 07:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071764, 740099, 27161, '<td valign="top">There is potential here.  I think some different lighting, color, or even a background off in the DOFy distance would help.</td>', 'There is potential here.  I think some different lighting, color, or even a background off in the DOFy distance would help.', '2008-11-19 07:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071765, 740277, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like a flexible straw in something carbonated but clear (7-Up?). The green stripe(s) and hint of blue in the bubbles make a nice combination. I wonder how it would look without the red and yellow components in the background.</td>', 'Looks like a flexible straw in something carbonated but clear (7-Up?). The green stripe(s) and hint of blue in the bubbles make a nice combination. I wonder how it would look without the red and yellow components in the background.', '2008-11-19 07:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071770, 740066, 27161, '<td valign="top">I expected to see a lot of oily/watery looking photos in this challenge so I was prepared to hate them, but this shot has those really great ripply looking things going on that strike me in a good way. 7</td>', 'I expected to see a lot of oily/watery looking photos in this challenge so I was prepared to hate them, but this shot has those really great ripply looking things going on that strike me in a good way. 7', '2008-11-19 07:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071772, 740124, 81362, '<td valign="top">Supermarket laser scanner? Nah, that would be oo big. Innards of a DVD player? Hmmmm. Will be fun to find out.</td>', 'Supermarket laser scanner? Nah, that would be oo big. Innards of a DVD player? Hmmmm. Will be fun to find out.', '2008-11-19 07:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071773, 738881, 27161, '<td valign="top">Coming off the smoke challenge, I really don''t want to see another one of these, but your angel slant serves it well. It looks like a ghost or big foot photo. 7</td>', 'Coming off the smoke challenge, I really don''t want to see another one of these, but your angel slant serves it well. It looks like a ghost or big foot photo. 7', '2008-11-19 07:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5071777, 738793, 27161, '<td valign="top">looks like a jug or bottle.  I think you need to try some different lighting techniques.  It looks a little over-saturated on the edges of the bottle.</td>', 'looks like a jug or bottle.  I think you need to try some different lighting techniques.  It looks a little over-saturated on the edges of the bottle.', '2008-11-19 07:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
