(5073562, 739976, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice.  This looks like a mechanical tuner for a guitar to me.  Fun composition, I might have tried rotating just slightly counter clockwise as the slant of the left spiral part gives a slight ''tilted horizon'' feel.  I like the colors, it looks like perhaps you used a bluish lighting?  Anyhow, I like the blue complimenting the gold of the sprocket.  Nice Job (I''m doing scoring after commenting/guessing).</td>', 'Nice.  This looks like a mechanical tuner for a guitar to me.  Fun composition, I might have tried rotating just slightly counter clockwise as the slant of the left spiral part gives a slight ''tilted horizon'' feel.  I like the colors, it looks like perhaps you used a bluish lighting?  Anyhow, I like the blue complimenting the gold of the sprocket.  Nice Job (I''m doing scoring after commenting/guessing).', '2008-11-19 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5073563, 740344, 48963, '<td valign="top">That''s beautiful! Looks like a slinky, but I''m wondering how you got all those colorful reflections - very nice! I like the color saturation and the composition too.</td>', 'That''s beautiful! Looks like a slinky, but I''m wondering how you got all those colorful reflections - very nice! I like the color saturation and the composition too.', '2008-11-19 16:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
