(5073842, 738979, 83080, '<td valign="top">Hey nice drill bits (and not the only ones in this challenge I might add).  I like the way you composed these although the lighting from the left seems a tad harsh.  Irregular things like these are so hard to center, it feels just slightly off and tilting from bottom left to upper right.  I think this actually is slightly off center and not just an optical illusion, even so, placing the tower off to a 1/3 line might have mitigated the natural imbalance of these shapes.  (all just my inexpert opinion of course).  Overall I like the creative way you used your bits. -6</td>', 'Hey nice drill bits (and not the only ones in this challenge I might add).  I like the way you composed these although the lighting from the left seems a tad harsh.  Irregular things like these are so hard to center, it feels just slightly off and tilting from bottom left to upper right.  I think this actually is slightly off center and not just an optical illusion, even so, placing the tower off to a 1/3 line might have mitigated the natural imbalance of these shapes.  (all just my inexpert opinion of course).  Overall I like the creative way you used your bits. -6', '2008-11-19 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
