(5079249, 740340, 52472, '<td valign="top">That is very mysterious, well done! Some extruded plastic wires, but I cannot make sense of the grooves on the surfaces.<br/>The colours are not the most appealing, I would have fiddled a bit with the background, or gone black &amp; white.</td>', 'That is very mysterious, well done! Some extruded plastic wires, but I cannot make sense of the grooves on the surfaces.The colours are not the most appealing, I would have fiddled a bit with the background, or gone black & white.', '2008-11-22 14:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
