(5083630, 740237, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. Composition and clarity are great. Colors are very good. Focus is good. And ... I like it. Well done.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. Composition and clarity are great. Colors are very good. Focus is good. And ... I like it. Well done.', '2008-11-25 14:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083635, 740239, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. Brilliant abstract. Looks like an ultramodern quilt design. I like the diagonal quadrants. Not normally a border fan but I like this.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. Brilliant abstract. Looks like an ultramodern quilt design. I like the diagonal quadrants. Not normally a border fan but I like this.', '2008-11-25 14:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083637, 739758, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. A fine abstract which I consider wall-worthy. Well done.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. A fine abstract which I consider wall-worthy. Well done.', '2008-11-25 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083640, 740324, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a stumper. A fine workmanlike image showing mastery of your camera, editing software, and a good eye. Well done.</td>', 'Not exactly a stumper. A fine workmanlike image showing mastery of your camera, editing software, and a good eye. Well done.', '2008-11-25 14:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083641, 739569, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. I like this image which is reminescent of Andy Warhol. Well done.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. I like this image which is reminescent of Andy Warhol. Well done.', '2008-11-25 14:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083642, 740264, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a stumper but an extraordinary image nevertheless. Great composition. Brilliant gradients. Super image.</td>', 'Not exactly a stumper but an extraordinary image nevertheless. Great composition. Brilliant gradients. Super image.', '2008-11-25 14:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083643, 740331, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a stumper. Very nice DOF and precise focus. Good work.</td>', 'Not exactly a stumper. Very nice DOF and precise focus. Good work.', '2008-11-25 14:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083646, 739993, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. Interesting abstract. A little too hot on the left IMO. Interesting DOF.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. Interesting abstract. A little too hot on the left IMO. Interesting DOF.', '2008-11-25 14:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083649, 740248, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. Attention grabbing. Processing feels a bit hot but it seems to work with your subject and it creates a lot of drama.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. Attention grabbing. Processing feels a bit hot but it seems to work with your subject and it creates a lot of drama.', '2008-11-25 14:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083651, 739828, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge.. I''m not resonating with the subject, however.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge.. I''m not resonating with the subject, however.', '2008-11-25 14:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083652, 739851, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. Love the vignette. Colors are great. DOF is interesting. Split subjects and the implied lines are pleasing. Well done!</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. Love the vignette. Colors are great. DOF is interesting. Split subjects and the implied lines are pleasing. Well done!', '2008-11-25 14:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083654, 740353, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a stumper but I like the post-industrial feel of this. On my calibrated monitor, it''s a little darkeer than I would prefer but that''s a matter of personal preference.</td>', 'Not exactly a stumper but I like the post-industrial feel of this. On my calibrated monitor, it''s a little darkeer than I would prefer but that''s a matter of personal preference.', '2008-11-25 14:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083657, 740081, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. I am not resonating with the subject or choice of colors, however. There seems to be a lot of distracting specks ... maybe sensor dust or dust on the subject. In advanced editing, I might have cloned the worst of it out of the image. But maybe your intent was to show the flaws. If so, it worked.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. I am not resonating with the subject or choice of colors, however. There seems to be a lot of distracting specks ... maybe sensor dust or dust on the subject. In advanced editing, I might have cloned the worst of it out of the image. But maybe your intent was to show the flaws. If so, it worked.', '2008-11-25 14:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083659, 740232, 18197, '<td valign="top">A stumper, so meets the challenge. I like the foreground/background tension in this. Details are good. You made an interesting DOF choice ... Some might prefer deeper DOF, not sure how I feel about it.</td>', 'A stumper, so meets the challenge. I like the foreground/background tension in this. Details are good. You made an interesting DOF choice ... Some might prefer deeper DOF, not sure how I feel about it.', '2008-11-25 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
