(5084734, 740274, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i> Not exactly a stumper but a lovely image nonetheless. Well captured and presented. Thank you for the simple background that isn''t some bizarre shade of purple or green (or heavens) both! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Notice, in all his comments on this challenge, he never says what he thinks they are. <strike>(I don''t think anyone had a closer guess than "glass" for this one.)</strike> I see one person did guess "oil".<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-26 00:50:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Dr.Confuser: Not exactly a stumper but a lovely image nonetheless. Well captured and presented. Thank you for the simple background that isn''t some bizarre shade of purple or green (or heavens) both!  Notice, in all his comments on this challenge, he never says what he thinks they are. (I don''t think anyone had a closer guess than "glass" for this one.) I see one person did guess "oil".', '2008-11-26 00:47:51.000000', '2008-11-26 00:50:59.000000', 0),
