(5085146, 740271, 47906, '<td valign="top">I think the diagonals in this image make it very strong and give it a good amount of depth, the contrasting background color along with the soft tone overall gives a a very subdued feeling to it. I love the control over the DOF and the textures amongst the diagonals. I am not quite sure how I feel about the vingetting, I thought it was neat as it made me feel as though I was looking through a microscope, but it my eye as it follows through on the diagonals is led into the black and leaves me wondering what else is out there.</td>', 'I think the diagonals in this image make it very strong and give it a good amount of depth, the contrasting background color along with the soft tone overall gives a a very subdued feeling to it. I love the control over the DOF and the textures amongst the diagonals. I am not quite sure how I feel about the vingetting, I thought it was neat as it made me feel as though I was looking through a microscope, but it my eye as it follows through on the diagonals is led into the black and leaves me wondering what else is out there.', '2008-11-26 07:23:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5085155, 740265, 47906, '<td valign="top">I loved the grate control on the DOF(pun intended. I really thought the bokeh was strong in the image toward the background in keeping the interest forward into the detailed area. The Detail in the sharp area was nicely lit and had a good amount of detail to it. The silver/gold color combination was really eye catching for me and provided interest throughout the photo. I really liked the diagonals and patterns created by the teeth on the cheese grater,along with the angle in which this was shot, it gave the photo a good amount of Depth to it as well.</td>', 'I loved the grate control on the DOF(pun intended. I really thought the bokeh was strong in the image toward the background in keeping the interest forward into the detailed area. The Detail in the sharp area was nicely lit and had a good amount of detail to it. The silver/gold color combination was really eye catching for me and provided interest throughout the photo. I really liked the diagonals and patterns created by the teeth on the cheese grater,along with the angle in which this was shot, it gave the photo a good amount of Depth to it as well.', '2008-11-26 07:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5085162, 739213, 90495, '<td valign="top"><i>Cool</i> shot.</td>', 'Cool shot.', '2008-11-26 07:38:25.000000', NULL, 0),
