(5085338, 740073, 80608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jomari:</b></div><hr/><i> You can''t just have people expend energy trying to guess what they are seeing and then never leave an explanation. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My apologies.... These are bubbles trap in a plastic sphere I bought from Ikea.<br/>placed a purple transpart sheet as a base and had a blue background.<br/>flash from side and below the purple sheet!</td>', 'Originally posted by jomari: You can''t just have people expend energy trying to guess what they are seeing and then never leave an explanation.   My apologies.... These are bubbles trap in a plastic sphere I bought from Ikea.placed a purple transpart sheet as a base and had a blue background.flash from side and below the purple sheet!', '2008-11-26 09:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
