(5736227, 739956, 67145, '<td valign="top">absolutely fantastic .. i love the processing you''ve done on this .. i photographed one of these today .. he landed on my leg which is pretty unusual .. i was photographing a very unusual little praying mantis at the time and the movement of turning the camera towards the butterfly made him fly away .. i got a gorgeous blur of wings leaving the shot .. lol .. <br/>anyhooo .. this is stunning .. :)</td>', 'absolutely fantastic .. i love the processing you''ve done on this .. i photographed one of these today .. he landed on my leg which is pretty unusual .. i was photographing a very unusual little praying mantis at the time and the movement of turning the camera towards the butterfly made him fly away .. i got a gorgeous blur of wings leaving the shot .. lol .. anyhooo .. this is stunning .. :)', '2009-11-21 17:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
